COMP 2404 B2 - Assignment #2

Name: Mohamed Azab
Student Number: 101331588

Program purpose:
This C++11 program manages a telephone company's subscribers and the
metadata of their sent and received text messages. The user can display
all subscribers and their messages, or show the most frequent sending
and receiving subscribers. Messages are stored once in the primary
telephone-company collection; subscribers reference those messages.

Files:
Control.h       Control.cc
Date.h          Date.cc
Msg.h           Msg.cc
MsgArray.h      MsgArray.cc
Subscriber.h    Subscriber.cc
Telco.h         Telco.cc
Time.h          Time.cc
View.h          View.cc
defs.h
main.cc
Makefile
README

Compiling (from the directory containing the source files):
    make

Running:
    ./a2

No command-line arguments or external data files are needed.

Menu:
    1 - Compute most frequent sender
    2 - Compute most frequent receiver
    3 - Print subscribers
    0 - Exit

Cleaning object files and the executable:
    make clean

Environment: Ubuntu Linux course VM with g++ and make; C++11 standard.
